<title>AUSTRALIA: Gold Mines of Sardinia pours first gold.</title>
<headline>Gold Mines of Sardinia pours first gold.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia-based Gold Mines of Sardinia Ltd said on Friday its 70 percent-owned subsidiary, Sardinia Gold Mining SpA, poured its first gold from the Furtei mine project in Sardinia, Italy, on June 26.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
